When the holder uses a contact move, it is protected from effects that would normally affect it. These include:

- HP loss from Rocky Helmet;
- Poisoning from Poison Point and HP loss from Spiky Shield;
- HP loss from Rough Skin and Iron Barbs;
- The effects of Flame Body, Static, Cursed Body, and Mummy.
